    "correctIndex": 0,
    "explanation": "Failure indications on the moving map can be quite subtle. The MFD in Figure 242 reflects a loss of position information, indicated by the removal of the aircraft symbol, compass labels, and other subtle differences. (PLT524, AA.I.A.K9) — FAA-H-8083-6 Answers (B) and (C) are incorrect because an AHRS or ADC failure would be depicted by red X’s on the PFD.",
