      "Green, yellow, and white beacon light.",
      "White and red beacon light with dual flash of the white.",
      "Green and white beacon light with dual flash of the white."
    ],
    "correctIndex": 0,
    "explanation": "A rotating beacon flashing green, yellow and white identifies a lighted heliport. (PLT141, AA.II.C.K3) — AIM ¶2-1-9 Answer (B) is incorrect because no type of airfield is marked by a white and red beacon with a dual flash of white. Answer (C) is incorrect because a green and white beacon light with a dual flash of the white identifies a military airfield.",
