    "fuente": "ATP",
    "capitulo": 2,
    "capituloTitulo": "Equipment, Navigation, and Facilities",
    "seccion": "Airport Lighting and Marking",
    "materia": "operaciones",
    "text": "A land and hold short operations (LAHSO) clearance, that the pilot accepts:",
    "options": [
      "must result in a landing.",
      "does not preclude a rejected landing.",
      "precludes a rejected landing."
    ],
    "correctIndex": 1,
    "explanation": "A LAHSO clearance, once accepted, must be adhered to unless an amended clearance is obtained or an emergency occurs. However, a LAHSO clearance does not preclude a rejected landing. (PLT140, AA.VI.F.R3b) — AIM ¶4-3-11",
