      "A normal approach, except do not extend the landing gear or flaps until over the runway threshold."
    ],
    "correctIndex": 0,
    "explanation": "Essentially, an engine-out approach and landing is the same as a normal approach and landing. (PLT223, AA.VII.C.K2) — FAA-H-8083-3",
