      "None.",
      "Increases with altitude.",
      "Decreases with altitude."
    ],
    "correctIndex": 2,
    "explanation": "For an airplane without supercharged engines, V MC decreases as altitude is increased. Consequently, directional control can be maintained at a lower airspeed than at sea level. (PLT314, AA.VII.B.K1) — FAA-H-8083-3 MC",
