    "seccion": "Maneuvering Flight",
    "materia": "operaciones",
    "text": "During a turn with constant power",
    "options": [
      "the aircraft nose will pitch down.",
      "the aircraft will decelerate.",
      "the rate of descent will increase."
    ],
    "correctIndex": 0,
    "explanation": "While in a turn, part of the vertical component of lift has been diverted to horizontal lift. If total lift is not increased (increase in angle of attack) the aircraft nose will pitch down. (PLT348, AA.IV.A.K2e) — FAA-H-8083-3",
    "cite": "ASA Airline Transport Pilot Test Prep 2025–2026 · Chapter 3 Aerodynamics · p. 3-11 · question 9823 · ALL",
