    "fuente": "ATP",
    "capitulo": 3,
    "capituloTitulo": "Aerodynamics",
    "seccion": "Maneuvering Flight",
    "materia": "operaciones",
    "text": "What is the relationship of the rate of turn with the radius of turn with a constant angle of bank but increasing airspeed?",
    "options": [
      "Rate will decrease and radius will increase.",
