    "seccion": "High Speed Flight",
    "materia": "operaciones",
    "text": "Swept wings causes a significant",
    "options": [
      "increase in effectiveness of flaps.",
      "reduction in effectiveness of flaps.",
      "flap actuation reliability issue."
    ],
    "correctIndex": 1,
    "explanation": "Thin airfoil sections with sweepback impose distinct limitations on the effectiveness of flaps. (PLT266, AA.I.D.K1) — ANA",
    "cite": "ASA Airline Transport Pilot Test Prep 2025–2026 · Chapter 3 Aerodynamics · p. 3-18 · question 9803 · ATM, ATS, ADX",
