      "10 miles."
    ],
    "correctIndex": 0,
    "explanation": "The usual radius from the airport of the inner circle is 5 NM in Class C airspace. (PLT040, AA.II.A.S6) — AIM ¶3-2-4 Answer (B) is incorrect because 7 NM is not established as the radius for any portion of Class C airspace. Answer (C) is incorrect because 10 NM is the radius of the outer circle of Class C airspace.",
