    "correctIndex": 1,
    "explanation": "Unless otherwise authorized by the Administrator, no person may operate an aircraft below 10,000 feet MSL at an indicated airspeed of more than 250 knots (288 mph). (PLT161, AA.I.G.K2) — 14 CFR §91.117",
