      "Class C airspace.",
      "Class B airspace.",
      "Class A airspace."
    ],
    "correctIndex": 2,
    "explanation": "ATC will not authorize VFR or VFR-on-top operations in Class A airspace. (PLT161, AA.II.A.S6) — AIM ¶5-5-13",
