    "options": [
      "continue the takeoff as briefed and handle the illumination as an inflight emergency.",
      "promptly abort the takeoff and plan on only having asymmetrical reverse thrust.",
      "abort the takeoff and plan for a maximum reverse thrust for deceleration."
    ],
    "correctIndex": 0,
    "explanation": "V is the critical engine failure speed or decision speed. 1 Engine failure below this speed shall result in an aborted takeoff; above this speed the takeoff run should be continued. (PLT208, AA.VII.B.K1) — FAA-H-8083-25",
