    "materia": "operaciones",
    "text": "(Refer to Figure 123.) You receive this ATC clearance: “…CLEARED TO THE ABC VORTAC. HOLD WEST ON THE TWO SEVEN ZERO RADIAL…” What is the recommended procedure to enter the holding pattern?",
    "options": [
