    "seccion": "Charts",
    "materia": "operaciones",
    "text": "(Refer to Figure 258.) As you approach DEPEW on the RNAV (GPS) RWY 32 approach, your GPS changes from “armed” to “active,” and the CDI needle begins to show increasing deviation to the left with no increase in cross track. In this situation, you",
