    "seccion": "Charts",
    "materia": "operaciones",
    "text": "(Refer to Figure 301.) During the approach (ILS RWY 10 at SYR) while maintaining an on glide slope indication with a groundspeed of 110 knots, what was the approximate rate of descent for PTZ 70?",
    "options": [
