  {
    "id": "q_la_ATP_2026_8799",
    "fuente": "ATP",
    "capitulo": 6,
    "capituloTitulo": "Flight Operations",
    "seccion": "Charts",
    "materia": "operaciones",
    "text": "(Refer to Figures 255A and 255B). Which approach control frequency is indicated for the TNP. DOWNE4 Arrival with LAX as the destination?",
    "options": [
