    "materia": "operaciones",
    "text": "Which is an effect of ice, snow, or frost formation on an airplane?",
    "options": [
      "Increased stall speed.",
      "Increased pitchdown tendencies.",
      "Increased angle of attack for stalls."
    ],
    "correctIndex": 0,
    "explanation": "Aircraft with ice, snow, or frost on the wings may experience increased stall speed, decreased angle of attack for stalls, and increased pitchup tendencies. (PLT493, AA.I.B.K6) — AC 20-117",
    "cite": "ASA Airline Transport Pilot Test Prep 2025–2026 · Chapter 8 Meteorology and Weather Services · p. 8-31 · question 9440 · ALL",
