    "correctIndex": 1,
    "explanation": "Temperatures close to the freezing point, large amounts of liquid water, high aircraft velocities, and large droplets are conducive to the formation of clear ice. (PLT493, AA.I.C.K3i) — AC 91-51",
    "cite": "ASA Airline Transport Pilot Test Prep 2025–2026 · Chapter 8 Meteorology and Weather Services · p. 8-31 · question 9449 · ALL",
