    ],
    "correctIndex": 1,
    "explanation": "Aircraft that have ice, snow, or frost on their surfaces must be carefully cleaned prior to beginning a flight because of the possible airflow disruption and loss of lift. (PLT128, AA.I.B.K6) — FAA-H-8083-25",
