    "correctIndex": 1,
    "explanation": "If cumulonimbus clouds are expected at the airport, “CB” is appended to the cloud layer which represents the base of the cumulonimbus cloud(s). Cumulonimbus clouds are the only cloud type forecast in TAFs. (PLT288, AA.I.C.K2) — FAA-H-8083-28",
